### Register
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"user@plugga.se","password":"123123"}

### Login (stores cookie)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"user@plugga.se","password":"123123"}

### Get posts (uses cookie from login)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/posts

### Create post (requires cookie)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Test","content":"Hello"}

### Create post with image (simpler)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/posts
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

title=Test Post&content=My content&image=@./path/to/image.jpg

### Update post (include author from the post or /api/users/me)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/posts/{{POST_ID}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"New","content":"Updated","author":"<AUTHOR_ID>"}